msgstr "The payment hasn't been confirmed yet. Please try again once the payment is complete."

#: storefront/views/monobank.py:2370
msgid "Замовлення не знайдено. Спробуйте ще раз."
msgstr "Order not found. Please try again."

#: storefront/views/monobank.py:2407
